# .dockerignore — shared superset for .NET / React build contexts.
# Copy into a project root as `.dockerignore`. Keeps the build context small and
# stops local secrets / build output from leaking into the image.

# .NET build output
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/TestResults/

# Node / frontend build output
**/node_modules/
**/dist/

# IDE / user files
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/*.user

# VCS & CI
**/.git/
**/.github/

# Secrets / environment (never bake into an image)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Docker files themselves
**/Dockerfile
**/.dockerignore
**/docker-compose*.yml
